 203:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_spi.c ****     [..]  This subsection provides a set of functions allowing to initialize and
 204:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_spi.c ****           de-initialize the SPIx peripheral:
 205:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_spi.c **** 
 206:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_spi.c ****       (+) User must implement HAL_SPI_MspInit() function in which he configures
 207:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_spi.c ****           all related peripherals resources (CLOCK, GPIO, DMA, IT and NVIC ).
 208:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_spi.c **** 
 209:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_spi.c ****       (+) Call the function HAL_SPI_Init() to configure the selected device with
 210:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_spi.c ****           the selected configuration:
 211:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_spi.c ****         (++) Mode
 212:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_spi.c ****         (++) Direction
 213:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_spi.c ****         (++) Data Size
 214:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_spi.c ****         (++) Clock Polarity and Phase
 215:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_spi.c ****         (++) NSS Management
 216:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_spi.c ****         (++) BaudRate Prescaler
 217:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_spi.c ****         (++) FirstBit
 218:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_spi.c ****         (++) TIMode
 219:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_spi.c ****         (++) CRC Calculation
 220:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_spi.c ****         (++) CRC Polynomial if CRC enabled
 221:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_spi.c ****         (++) CRC Length, used only with Data8 and Data16
 222:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_spi.c ****         (++) FIFO reception threshold
 223:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_spi.c ****         (++) FIFO transmission threshold
 224:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_spi.c **** 
 225:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_spi.c ****       (+) Call the function HAL_SPI_DeInit() to restore the default configuration
 226:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_spi.c ****           of the selected SPIx peripheral.
